    {
      "id": 256667,
      "name": "FrivYeti",
      "username": "FrivYeti",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/frivyeti/{size}/1919_2.png",
      "created_at": "2024-01-30T17:51:03.512Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Oh no, that’s awful. Sending best wishes to Christopher.</p>\n<p>I would like to double-up on “do not do double episodes when you get back, rest and recover” with a minor caveat for “unless doing double episodes legitimately makes you feel better and helps the recovery process”, because people do recover differently. But yeah, I’m not going to be pacing back and forth growling about where the podcast is.</p>\n<p>Fingers crossed for a smooth surgery and steady recovery process.</p>",
      "post_number": 7,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2024-01-30T17:51:03.512Z",
