      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/ba8739/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2024-01-30T21:06:56.089Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yes, please take the time to recover. We understand recording the podcast is a labor of love, and we the fans certainly enjoy listening to it as well. However, we want Sentinel Comics content to continue in the future (particularly through completion of <em>Definitive Edition</em>) and the SC creative team has already suffered too many losses.</p>\n<p>I will back up the notion of an Adam &amp; Paul podcast, even if only for the fact that we haven’t heard their letters song yet.</p>",
